max-cap-buffer: MAX_CAP_BUFFER = 1024

Classification: profile setting.

The capacity of TPMS_CAPABILITY_DATA is a profile choice; version 185 raises
it to 3072 octets, tpm-rs (like the public mstpm20 and ibmswtpm2 profiles)
uses 1024, which determines how many entries a TPM2_GetCapability response
holds (moreData) and the reported TPM_PT_MAX_CAP_BUFFER.
diff --git a/TPMCmd/TpmConfiguration/TpmConfiguration/TpmProfile_Misc.h b/TPMCmd/TpmConfiguration/TpmConfiguration/TpmProfile_Misc.h
--- a/TPMCmd/TpmConfiguration/TpmConfiguration/TpmProfile_Misc.h
+++ b/TPMCmd/TpmConfiguration/TpmConfiguration/TpmProfile_Misc.h
@@ -28,7 +28,7 @@
 #define MAX_DIGEST_BUFFER          1024
 #define MAX_NV_INDEX_SIZE          8500
 #define MAX_NV_BUFFER_SIZE         1024
-#define MAX_CAP_BUFFER             3072
+#define MAX_CAP_BUFFER             1024
 #define NV_MEMORY_SIZE             131072
 #define MIN_COUNTER_INDICES        8
 #define NUM_STATIC_PCR             16
